  "body": "# System inventory\n\nUse to capture a compact, repeatable system inventory on Ubuntu.\n\n```bash\nuname -a\nlscpu | head -20      # CPU/arch\nfree -h               # memory\ndf -h /               # root disk\nip -brief addr        # interfaces\n```\n",
